# 🛠 SKILL — Cargo Check & Crystallize

> **Authority**: caw:/minispace/.know/canon/LIFECYCLE.ail
> **Branch**: `go:/olym/k/cogninfer/skills/`
> **RRP**: `t:/gopia/olym/k/cogninfer/skills/cargo-check-crystallize.ail`

---

## SK-CCC-1 — Setup (một lần)

```powershell
# Verify shared infra exists
Test-Path caw:/minispace/.cargo/config.toml
Test-Path caw:/minispace/.shared-target
Test-Path caw:/minispace/.shared-vendor
Test-Path caw:/minispace/.shared-registry

# Nếu chưa có, init:
New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path caw:/minispace/.shared-target
New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path caw:/minispace/.shared-vendor
New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path caw:/minispace/.shared-registry/{github,crates-io,local,company}

# Populate vendor từ crates.io
cargo vendor caw:/minispace/.shared-vendor
```

## SK-CCC-2 — Check (verify assembly)

```powershell
# Trong caw:/minispace/{ws-*}/
Set-Location caw:/minispace/ws-<name>

# Cargo check
cargo check --release `
  --target-dir caw:/minispace/.shared-target

# Verify no error
if ($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0) {
    Write-Error "cargo check FAILED — handoff to ha:/engine/"
}
```

## SK-CCC-3 — Test (smoke integration)

```powershell
Set-Location caw:/minispace/ws-<name>

# Cargo test (smoke only tại CAW layer)
cargo test --release `
  --target-dir caw:/minispace/.shared-target

if ($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0) {
    Write-Error "cargo test FAILED — diagnose + handoff"
}
```

## SK-CCC-4 — Crystallize (build → strip → sign → pack)

```powershell
Set-Location caw:/minispace/ws-<name>

# Build release
cargo build --release `
  --target-dir caw:/minispace/.shared-target

if ($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0) {
    Write-Error "cargo build FAILED — diagnose"
}

# Strip symbols (giảm size)
strip caw:/minispace/.shared-target/release/<name>.exe `
      --strip-unneeded

# Sign (RNA Ed25519)
& t:/tools/sign/rna-sign.ps1 `
    -Input caw:/minispace/.shared-target/release/<name>.<ext> `
    -Key t:/keys/<key_id>.key `
    -Output caw:/minispace/ws-<name>/release/<name>.<ext>

# Pack manifest
@{
    name = "<name>"
    version = "0.1.0"
    hash = (Get-FileHash caw:/minispace/ws-<name>/release/<name>.<ext>).Hash
    signed_by = "<key_id>"
    timestamp = (Get-Date -Format "o")
} | ConvertTo-Json | Out-File caw:/minispace/ws-<name>/release/<name>.manifest.json
```

## SK-CCC-5 — Release (publish to workspace + GitHub)

```powershell
# Copy artifact to ws-* release/
Copy-Item caw:/minispace/.shared-target/release/<name>.<ext> `
          caw:/minispace/ws-<name>/release/

# Publisher push to gh:cosda-dev/<workspace>-release
git push origin main
# → trigger CI: sign + tag + publish
```

## SK-CCC-6 — Error Matrix

| Error | Diagnose | Handoff |
|---|---|---|
| `cargo check` fail | run `cargo check --message-format=json` | ha:/engine/ |
| `cargo test` fail | check stderr excerpt | ha:/engine/<mod>/r/ |
| `cargo build` fail | check link error | ha:/engine/<mod>/ |
| `strip` fail | artifact type mismatch | Builder retry |
| `sign` fail | key not found | check t:/keys/ |
| `pack` fail | manifest invalid | Producer fix |

## SK-CCC-7 — Best Practices

1. **Luôn dùng `--release`** tại CAW layer.
2. **Luôn trỏ `--target-dir`** về `.shared-target/`.
3. **Không duplicate** vendor/target per workspace.
4. **Smoke test only** tại CAW — full test tại Forge.
5. **Sign trước khi release** — unsealed artifact = VIOLATION.
6. **Manifest bắt buộc** cho mỗi artifact.

